extends ../layouts/layout

block content
  .container.py-5
    .row.justify-content-center
      .col-md-6.text-center
        .bg-danger.bg-opacity-10.rounded-circle.d-inline-flex.align-items-center.justify-content-center.mb-4(
          style="width: 120px; height: 120px;"
        )
          i.fas.fa-exclamation-triangle.text-danger.fa-4x

        h1.display-4.fw-bold.text-danger 500
        h3.fw-bold.mb-3 Error del servidor
        p.text-muted.mb-4
          | Ha ocurrido un error inesperado. Por favor, intenta nuevamente o contacta al administrador.

        .d-flex.justify-content-center.gap-2
          a.btn.btn-primary.rounded-pill.px-4(href="/")
            i.fas.fa-home.me-1
            | Ir al Dashboard
          button.btn.btn-outline-secondary.rounded-pill.px-4(
            type="button"
            onclick="history.back()"
          )
            i.fas.fa-arrow-left.me-1
            | Volver